/p> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p>This one should be in the Louvre!&nbsp; <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogphotos/Vacationatyourownperil_7D79/DSC002551.jpg"><img style="border-right:0px;border-top:0px;border-left:0px;border-bottom:0px;" height="180" src="http://cromwellhaus.com/blogphotos/Vacationatyourownperil_7D79/DSC00255.jpg" width="240" border="0" alt="" /></a></p><div style="clear:both;"></div>

